ed\n *   by board_late_initialize() or from the board-specific startup logic\n *   if CONFIG_BOARD_LATE_INITIALIZE is not selected.\n *\n ****************************************************************************/\n\nint board_app_initialize(uintptr_t arg)\n{\n  return stm32_bringup();\n}\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"61257666-978f-4ad6-a29c-1bb4f4124cdb","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/warner/openvela","sessionId":"6ad13cb3-6473-4031-a8c5-8ad621057323","version":"2.1.237","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
