{"parentUuid":"0df79c7d-4699-4e52-91dc-c2c90ccc05e5","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"msg_e63ca11540af4b69871b1ba2","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants to know how to test the board after flashing the firmware. Since the STM32N657X0 has no internal flash, the firmware needs to run from SRAM or XSPI flash. Let me explain the testing process.\n\nKey points:\n1. STM32N657X0 has NO internal flash - code must run from SRAM or external XSPI flash\n2. The firmware we compiled runs from SRAM (0x34000400)\n3. For DEV boot mode, the firmware is loaded into SRAM by the debugger (ST-Link)\n4. For production boot mode, an FSBL is needed to initialize XSPI flash and load the main app\n\nLet me explain the testing process step by step.","signature":""}],"usage":{"input_tokens":560,"output_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":87744}},"type":"assistant","uuid":"527a812f-33d2-4534-8909-0fa7237d6305","timestamp":"2026-08-21T13:46:20.371Z","effort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/warner/openvela","sessionId":"6ad13cb3-6473-4031-a8c5-8ad621057323","version":"2.1.237","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"synthetic-wandering-llama"}
{"parentUuid":"527a812f-33d2-4534-8909-0fa7237d6305","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"msg_e63ca11540af4b69871b1ba2","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## STM32N657X0 烧录和测试方法\n\nSTM32N657X0 没有内部 flash，有两种启动模式：\n\n### 方法一：DEV Boot Mode（开发调试模式，推荐先用这个）\n\n这种方式通过 ST-Link 调试器直接将固件加载到 SRAM 中运行，**不需要 FSBL**。\n\n**硬件连接：**\n```\nST-Link V2/V3  ────  NUCLEO-N657X0-Q\n    SWDIO       ────  PA13 (SWDIO)\n    SWCLK       ────  PA14 (SWCLK)\n    GND         ────  GND\n    VCC         ────  3.3V (可选)\n    \nUSB 虚拟串口 (ST-Link VCP):\n    TX (PE5)    ────  串口终端\n    RX (PE6)    ────  串口终端\n```\n\n**Boot 模式配置：**\n```\nBOOT0 = 0 (DEV mode)\nBOOT1 = 0\n```\n\n**烧录步骤（使用 ST-Link CLI）：**\n```bash\n# 安装 stlink-tools (Linux)\nsudo apt install stlink-tools\n\n# 烧录到 SRAM\nst-flash write nuttx.bin 0x34000400\n\n# 或者使用 OpenOCD\nopenocd -f interface/stlink.cfg -f target/stm32n6x.cfg \\\n  -c \"program nuttx.bin 0x34000400 verify reset exit\"\n```\n\n**使用 STM32CubeProgrammer（推荐）：**\n1. 打开 STM32CubeProgrammer\n2. 选择 ST-Link 连接\n3. 设置地址: `0x34000400`\n4. 加载 `nuttx.bin`\n5. 点击 \"Download\"\n\n**串口终端连接：**\n```bash\n# Linux\nminicom -D /dev/ttyACM0 -b 115200\n\n# 或使用 screen\nscreen /dev/ttyACM0 115200\n\n# Windows\n# 使用 PuTTY 或 SecureCRT，选择 COM 口，波特率 115200\n```\n\n### 方法二：Production Boot Mode（生产模式，需要 FSBL）\n\n这种方式需要 FSBL 初始化 XSPI flash，然后加载主应用。\n\n```\nBoot ROM → FSBL (SRAM) → 主应用 (XSPI flash XIP)\n```\n\n**需要实现：**\n1. FSBL 固件（初始化 XSPI flash）\n2. 将主应用烧录到 XSPI flash\n3. Boot ROM 自动加载 FSBL\n\n### 测试步骤\n\n**Step 1: 连接硬件**\n```\n1. 用 USB 线连接 ST-Link 到电脑\n2. 确认 ST-Link 驱动已安装\n3. 连接串口终端 (115200 8N1)\n```\n\n**Step 2: 设置 Boot 模式**\n```\nBOOT0 = 0 (DEV mode)\nBOOT1 = 0\n```\n\n**Step 3: 烧录固件**\n```bash\n# 使用 st-flash\nst-flash write nuttx.bin 0x34000400\n\n# 或使用 STM32CubeProgrammer\n# 地址: 0x34000400\n# 文件: nuttx.bin\n```\n\n**Step 4: 复位并观察串口输出**\n```\n预期输出 (NuttX NSH):\nNuttShell (NSH) NuttX-10.0.0\nnsh> \n```\n\n**Step 5: 测试基本命令**\n```\nnsh> help\nnsh> ls /dev\nnsh> ps\nnsh> uname -a\n```\n\n### 可能遇到的问题\n\n| 问题 | 原因 | 解决方案 |\n|------|------|----------|\n| 无串口输出 | 串口配置错误 | 检查 USART1 引脚 PE5/PE6 |\n| HardFault | 内存地址错误 | 检查 RAM_START=0x34000400 |\n| 无法烧录 | Boot 模式错误 | 确保 BOOT0=0 (DEV mode) |\n| 启动后卡死 | 时钟配置错误 | 检查 board.h 中的 PLL 配置 |\n\n### 调试工具\n\n```bash\n# 使用 GDB 调试\narm-none-eabi-gdb nuttx\n(gdb) target remote :3333\n(gdb) load\n(gdb) break main\n(gdb) continue\n\n# 使用 OpenOCD 启动 GDB 服务器\nopenocd -f interface/stlink.cfg -f target/stm32n6x.cfg\n```\n\n### 下一步\n\n1. **先测试 DEV 模式** —— 确认固件能正常运行\n2. **实现 FSBL** —— 参考 `nucleo-n657x0-q-fsbl-guide.md`\n3. **测试 XSPI flash** —— 验证外部 flash 读写\n4. **实现掉电保存** —— 将固件烧录到 XSPI flash\n\n需要我帮你实现 FSBL 吗？"}],"usage":{"input_tokens":560,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":87744,"output_tokens":1368,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"3a7ffc7f-9611-42fe-a165-9dcafc92902b","timestamp":"2026-08-21T13:46:35.210Z","effort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/warner/openvela","sessionId":"6ad13cb3-6473-4031-a8c5-8ad621057323","version":"2.1.237","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"synthetic-wandering-llama"}
