{"parentUuid":"ebc73150-cb75-4fca-bce8-9fd9ed7d7d8b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"msg_f6721ee654ed40298aa9bc0e","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","content":[{"type":"text","text":"编译成功！固件已更新。\n\n**修改内容：**\n在 `stm32_boot.c` 的 `stm32_board_initialize()` 中添加了 LED 无限闪烁循环：\n- LD6 (PG0, 绿色) 以约 1Hz 频率闪烁（500ms 亮，500ms 灭）\n- 这是最早的启动代码，不依赖任何外设初始化\n- 如果 LED 闪烁，说明 CPU 在正常运行\n\n**烧录测试：**\n\n```bash\n# 方法1: st-flash\nst-flash write /home/warner/openvela/nuttx/build/nuttx.bin 0x34000400\n\n# 方法2: STM32CubeProgrammer\n# 地址: 0x34000400\n# 文件: /home/warner/openvela/nuttx/build/nuttx.bin\n```\n\n**预期结果：**\n- 绿色 LED (LD6) 以约 1 秒周期闪烁\n- 串口无输出是正常的（代码在串口初始化之前就进入了无限循环）\n\n**后续调试：**\n如果 LED 闪烁正常，说明板子硬件没问题。串口无输出可能是：\n1. USART1 引脚配置错误（检查 PE5/PE6）\n2. 时钟配置问题（PLL 未正确初始化）\n3. 波特率不匹配\n\n需要我把 LED 闪烁改成正常启动流程（不在无限循环中卡住），同时添加串口调试输出吗？"}],"usage":{"input_tokens":462,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":92736,"output_tokens":352,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"5d8a4396-a6a7-45ed-bc2b-b568cfef34a3","timestamp":"2026-08-21T14:09:26.996Z","effort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/warner/openvela","sessionId":"6ad13cb3-6473-4031-a8c5-8ad621057323","version":"2.1.237","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"synthetic-wandering-llama"}
